        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/29/apple-announces-when-you-can-start-the-iphone-duo-pre-order-process/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-duo-night-sky-front-back.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo pre-orders start on Friday, October 16, but Apple just announced when you can get an early start on the process. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072003\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/29/apple-announces-when-you-can-start-the-iphone-duo-pre-order-process/#more-1072003\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
