        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/leaked-images-reveal-new-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/apple-tv-homepod-mini-siri-ai.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is expected to <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/apple-has-big-october-coming-for-new-hardware-and-software-heres-the-lineup/\">launch new Home products in October</a>, and today via <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/25/new-ipad-mini-homepod-mini-apple-tv-leaked/\">leaked images</a> discovered by <em>MacRumors</em> contributor Aaron Perris, we get our first glimpse at what’s coming.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv,apple-tv-4k,homepod-mini\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071543\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/leaked-images-reveal-new-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini/#more-1071543\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
