        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/zero-to-agent-in-30-minutes-give-your-agent-its-own-computer/",
        "content_text": "In the most recent episode of Zero to Agent in 30 Minutes, AI engineer Sajal Sharma showed how to use a remote sandbox to let your agents install software, run commands, and control a browser without endangering your everyday machine. In effect, you’re giving your agents a computer of their own. Sajal demonstrated both approaches [&#8230;]",
