        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/The-iPhone-Duo-is-Apple-at-its-absolute-best.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo is <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/09/apple-confirms-iphone-duo-release-date-for-october-details-here/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1068741\">coming October 23</a>, but there are several unannounced features coming to its StandBy mode that were just discovered hidden in Apple code.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071738\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/28/leak-reveals-new-iphone-duo-features-not-yet-announced/#more-1071738\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
