        "title": "Apple TV unveils chilling serial killer thriller based on bestselling novel",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/29/apple-tv-unveils-chilling-serial-killer-thriller-based-on-bestselling-novel/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/nocturne-liev-schreiber-hat.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today Apple TV <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/news/2026/09/apple-tv-unveils-trailer-for-nocturne-the-gripping-new-drama-led-by-liev-schreiber-and-zazie-beetz-and-stars-stephen-graham/\">unveiled</a> the trailer for Nocturne, a new thriller series based on bestselling crime novel “The Sandman” by Lars Kepler.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071878\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/29/apple-tv-unveils-chilling-serial-killer-thriller-based-on-bestselling-novel/#more-1071878\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
