        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/airpods.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/09/apple-unveils-airpods-5-with-upgraded-noise-cancellation-more/\">debuted</a> the all-new AirPods 5 this month, and they bring ANC to lower prices than ever before. If you’re shopping for AirPods, however, there are still several reasons you might want to opt for the more expensive AirPods Pro 3.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Buy AirPods Pro <strong>$234</strong> (Reg. $249)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Buy AirPods 5 <strong>$129</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Buy AirPods 5 with Wireless Charging Case <strong>$149</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"airpods,airpods-5,airpods-pro-3\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071710\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/28/airpods-pro-3-vs-airpods-5/#more-1071710\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
