        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/openai-accuses-apple-of-improperly-adding-new-evidence-to-trade-secrets-case/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-openai.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">OpenAI and the other defendants in Apple’s trade secret misappropriation lawsuit made a new filing, asking the court to strike two expert declarations and disregard other evidence Apple recently submitted. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,openai\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071625\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/openai-accuses-apple-of-improperly-adding-new-evidence-to-trade-secrets-case/#more-1071625\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
