        "title": "Apple Card adds new feature in iOS 27 that every card should have",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/apple-card-adds-new-feature-in-ios-27-that-every-card-should-have/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/10/apple-card-fi.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 brings a <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/08/heres-everything-new-for-apple-wallet-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1055623\">variety of new features to Apple Wallet</a>, including one exclusive to Apple Card that I wish every card offered: a hub for all recurring transactions.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-card,apple-wallet,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1061798\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/apple-card-adds-new-feature-in-ios-27-that-every-card-should-have/#more-1061798\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
