        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/apple-tv-has-too-many-good-shows-on-now-and-i-cant-keep-up/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/08/apple-tv-logo.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://tv.apple.com/channel/tvs.sbd.4000?itscg=30200&amp;itsct=tv%5C_box%5C_link&amp;at=1000l3cvR\">Apple TV</a> has been called “the new HBO” for its focus on quality over quantity. But recently, the streamer has starting ramping its lineup of shows I want to watch, and I can’t keep up.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071594\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/apple-tv-has-too-many-good-shows-on-now-and-i-cant-keep-up/#more-1071594\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
